{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-9","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平面与平行线与线段","englishTitle":"Straight lines which are parallel to the same straight line and are not in the same plane with it are also parallel to one another.","book":11,"number":9,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.9","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.9/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":9,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-9@raw-87673789f81099ae","contentId":"euclid-11-9","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"87673789f81099ae4102dc4ee9c4a493c9b5c3fd5c9ace1e37eed5158fde4ee8","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-9.statement","euclid-11-9.construction.1","euclid-11-9.construction.2","euclid-11-9.proof.1","euclid-11-9.proof.2","euclid-11-9.proof.3","euclid-11-9.proof.4","euclid-11-9.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-9.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-9","revisionId":"euclid-11-9@raw-87673789f81099ae","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b20d908fea689a1f630888b3965f0c59c34b62d070e0d126dea5e98fa81be135","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Straight lines which are parallel to the same straight line and are not in the same plane with it are also parallel to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"直线线与同一直线平行,但并非同一直线线的直线与同一直线的直线不相平行,也彼此平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-9.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-9","revisionId":"euclid-11-9@raw-87673789f81099ae","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bde9d3e4e2e5b870fd83e6e05356e063cd9459b8bb890ee94a3ae07599e4f5d3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let each of the straight lines AB, CD be parallel to EF, not being in the same plane with it; I say that AB is parallel to CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB,CD线的每条线都与EF线平行,而不是与AB线平行;我说,AB线与CD线平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-9.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-11-9","revisionId":"euclid-11-9@raw-87673789f81099ae","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d3cd79c8fe220bdf8391d2c362706e92b5f138d15b2f23047787515941f51939","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let a point G be taken at random on EF, and from it let there be drawn GH, in the plane through EF, AB, at right angles to EF, and GK in the plane through FE, CD again at right angles to EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"随机测算G点,从中得出GH点,平面至EF点,AB点,直角至EF点,GK点,平面至FE点,CD点,直角至EF点。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-9.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-9","revisionId":"euclid-11-9@raw-87673789f81099ae","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3673fcf2351b1d88c42515fe86c9276fd97ffbbcdbfa85019563c06f047772ff","citations":["euclid-11-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since EF is at right angles to each of the straight lines GH, GK, therefore EF is also at right angles to the plane through GH, GK. [[XI. 4](/principles/euclid-11-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,EF是GH线的直角,GK线,EF线的直角至平面至GH线的GK线。 [[XI. 4](/principles/euclid-11-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-9.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-9","revisionId":"euclid-11-9@raw-87673789f81099ae","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"466295d45037f7f4a7217cbe89e7c0edc76f50bd6d6ba282c6a59c557cd16c2d","citations":["euclid-11-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And EF is parallel to AB; therefore AB is also at right angles to the plane through HG, GK. [[XI. 8](/principles/euclid-11-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EF与AB平行;因此,AB为直角至平面至HG,GK。 [[XI. 8](/principles/euclid-11-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-9.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-9","revisionId":"euclid-11-9@raw-87673789f81099ae","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4a9eaffc53bbd1fb464591162fa9d0dc02f48d31a0a16fec98ddfa82eba1b1e2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason CD is also at right angles to the plane through HG, GK; therefore each of the straight lines AB, CD is at right angles to the plane through HG, GK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,CD线也为直角至平面至HG,GK,因此,AB直线中的每一条直线为直角至平面至HG,GK直线为GK。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-9.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-9","revisionId":"euclid-11-9@raw-87673789f81099ae","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bfc433a5223b9fd7005ebffa101574bbd561bca10538c84bcc2ee8d2568616ba","citations":["euclid-11-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But if two straight lines be at right angles to the same plane, the straight lines are parallel; [[XI. 6](/principles/euclid-11-6)] therefore AB is parallel to CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果两条直线为直角到平面,则直线是平行的;因此,AB直线与CD直线是平行的。 [[XI. 6](/principles/euclid-11-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-9.source","contentId":"euclid-11-9","revisionId":"euclid-11-9@raw-87673789f81099ae","order":7,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"132f7175ccc3d307f8b7a473addb923a99c36ca0ae92466bb1244a7f9c8b8ec9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.9/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.9\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-9:euclid-11-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-9","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-9.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.9","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.9/","sourceLabel":"XI. 4"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-9:euclid-11-8:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-9","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-9.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-8","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.9","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.9/","sourceLabel":"XI. 8"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-9:euclid-11-6:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-9","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-9.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-6","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perse